---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---

<Legal
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund policy for Hosted openagent.email once public checkout opens."
>
  <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: September 6, 2026</p>
  <p class="lede">
    Hosted Pro is a one-time purchase, currently waitlist. Public checkout is not open yet.
  </p>
  <p>
    When checkout opens and you purchase Hosted Pro, you may request a full refund within 30 days
    of purchase.
  </p>
  <p>
    After 30 days, any refund is the remaining balance after deducting a monthly service amount
    for each month of service used from the purchase price, to a minimum of $0.00. The monthly
    amount and purchase price will be stated on the checkout page when it opens.
  </p>
  <p>
    To request help after a purchase, include the email used on the order.
  </p>
  <p>
    Payment (when checkout opens): Secure checkout via Creem — Alipay supported.
  </p>
  <p>
    To join the waitlist now, email
    <a href="mailto:support@openagent.email?subject=Hosted%20Pro%20waitlist">support@openagent.email</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
